@startuml pipeline-flow
title Vid2Tweet Pipeline Flow

start

:User pastes YouTube URL;
:Frontend triggers Kestra pipeline;

fork
  :Download Audio\n(yt-dlp + FFmpeg);
  :Validate duration ≤ 20 min;
  :Compress to MP3 <25MB;
fork again
  :Download Video (low quality);
  :Extract best frame (1/3 duration);
  :Compress thumbnail <5MB;
end fork

:Transcribe Audio\n(Groq Whisper);

:Generate Tweet\n(Groq Llama 3.3 70B);
:Validate tweet ≤ 280 chars;

:Human Approval Checkpoint;
note right: Pipeline PAUSES here\nFrontend shows preview

if (User approves?) then (yes)
  :Post Tweet to Twitter/X\n(with thumbnail image);
  :Save result to PostgreSQL;
  :Pipeline SUCCESS;
else (no)
  :Log rejection;
  :Pipeline terminates\n(no tweet posted);
endif

stop

@enduml
